2
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:14,000
いきなり歌い始めてごめんね
Sorry for starting to sing so suddenly,

3
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,800
ちょっとだけそのままで聞いててね
but please listen just a little bit.

4
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,000
本日お伝えしたいのは
What I want to tell you today

5
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,500
とっても大事な君のこと！
is something very important about you!

6
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:24,000
たまにはケンカもしてきたけど
We've had our arguments sometimes,

7
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,100
だからこそ何でも知ってんだ
but that's why I know everything about you.

8
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:28,000
君の長所は真面目なこと
Your best quality is your earnestness,

9
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,000
ただ妄想癖がひどい！
but your delusional tendencies are terrible!

10
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,800
君が飛び降りるのならば
If you're going to jump,

11
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:35,500
僕は笑って一緒に飛び降りる
I'll laugh and jump right along with you.

12
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,500
止めてくれるとでも思ったか！
Did you really think I'd stop you?!

13
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:39,800
僕らの絆をみくびるか！
Do you underestimate our bond?!

14
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,500
そして手をつないで落ちて行こう
And let's fall hand in hand,

15
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:44,500
地面めがけてピースしよう
flashing peace signs toward the ground.

16
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:48,800
でもそういえば何かを忘れているような
But come to think of it, it feels like we forgot something...

17
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,000
ああそうだ！見たいテレビがあった！
Ah, right! There's a TV show I wanted to watch!

18
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:57,000
やっぱり飛ぶの後でにしませんか！
Let's postpone jumping after all!

19
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:01,000
君に出会ってからというもの
Ever since I met you...

20
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:01,860
沈むように溶けていくように
Like sinking, like melting away

21
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,320
二人だけの空が広がる夜に
On a night when only the two of us could see the sky

22
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,390
「さよなら」だけだった
It was just "Goodbye"

23
00:05:04,670 --> 00:05:05,610
その一言で全てが分かった
That one word made everything clear

24
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:06,930
日が沈み出した空と君の姿
The setting sun and your figure

25
00:05:07,090 --> 00:05:07,850
フェンス越しに重なっていた
Overlapped across the fence

26
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:09,250
初めて会った日から
From the day we first met

27
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,810
僕の心の全てを奪った
You stole everything from my heart

28
00:05:11,030 --> 00:05:12,160
どこか儚い空気を纏う君は
You, who had a somewhat ephemeral aura about you

29
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:13,570
寂しい目をしていたんだ
Had lonely eyes

30
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,470
いつだってチックタックと鳴る世界で
In a world that ticks on and on

31
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:17,090
何回だってさ
No matter how many times

32
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,650
君が飛び降りるのならば僕は
If you're going to jump, then I'll jump too

33
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:21,590
君よりも先に飛び降りる
I'll jump down even before you do

34
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,280
説得されるとでも思ったか!
Did you think I'd try to talk you out of it?

35
00:05:23,580 --> 00:05:24,960
僕の馬鹿さを侮るな!
Don't underestimate my foolishness!

36
00:05:25,650 --> 00:05:27,730
え、何、あの漫画の主人公が
Hey, what is it? The protagonist of that manga

37
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:29,370
本州(ラスボス)を倒したって?
Defeated the final boss?

38
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:31,410
って何回言えばわかるんだ
I know that, because I've read it so many times!

39
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,630
僕は単行本派なんだ!
I'm all about the bound volumes!

40
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:36,510
ああ次が出るのいつだっけ
Ah, when does the next volume come out again?

41
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:39,440
それを読むまでは絶対許さない!
Until I read that, I will never forgive you!

42
00:05:53,458 --> 00:05:53,728
いつか僕らは
Someday, we will

43
00:05:56,518 --> 00:05:58,378
答え合わせするのかな
Match our answers together

44
00:06:03,318 --> 00:06:04,678
そんな未来は
Such a future

45
00:06:07,308 --> 00:06:10,298
忘れたままで決めたままで
I'll keep it forgotten until then

46
00:06:11,028 --> 00:06:12,148
さあさあ レディース・エン・ジェントルメン
Now then, ladies and gentlemen

47
00:06:12,418 --> 00:06:13,618
これよりお目にかけますわ
For your viewing pleasure is

48
00:06:14,968 --> 00:06:15,798
一世一代の大舞台
A once-in-a-lifetime grand stage

49
00:06:17,668 --> 00:06:18,838
長くてもどうぞごゆっくり
Long though it may be, please take your time

50
00:06:20,098 --> 00:06:22,238
君が飛び降りるのならば僕は
If you're going to jump, then I'll jump too

51
00:06:22,318 --> 00:06:24,418
笑って一緒に飛び降りる
Laughing, I'll jump down right along with you

52
00:06:24,658 --> 00:06:25,968
止めてくれるとでも思ったか!
Did you think I'd try to stop you?

53
00:06:26,288 --> 00:06:27,728
僕らの絆を見くびるか!
Look closely at the bond between us!

54
00:06:29,158 --> 00:06:30,658
次に僕らが出会う世界でも
Even in the world we meet in next

55
00:06:32,138 --> 00:06:33,668
またこんな風になれたらいいね
How nice it would be if it's like this again

56
00:06:34,338 --> 00:06:36,498
生まれ変わったら何になるか
If we're reincarnated, what will we become?

57
00:06:36,618 --> 00:06:38,568
本で占ってみようか?
Shall we try telling our fortune with books?

58
00:06:39,348 --> 00:06:41,588
君は「玉ねぎ」僕は「タイヤ」
You are "Onion," and I am "Tire"

59
00:06:43,158 --> 00:06:44,948
やっぱり飛ぶの今度にしませんか……?
Shall we make our next flight sooner, after all...!?

60
00:06:47,688 --> 00:06:49,518
ホントのホントに飛べる日を目指して
To be able to truly, truly fly someday

61
00:06:52,538 --> 00:06:54,828
もうちょっとだけ一緒に居ませんか!
Won't you stay with me just a little longer!?

62
00:07:05,148 --> 00:07:05,468
Unhappy? 悩める人の子よ
Unhappy? To all you troubled souls out there

63
00:07:06,178 --> 00:07:06,698
Unlucky? 人成らざる者も
Unlucky? To those who don't fit in as humans

64
00:07:07,678 --> 00:07:08,638
Be happy! 絶えず目指せよ
Be happy! Keep aiming forward without stopping

65
00:07:09,388 --> 00:07:10,298
生きているんだし目を逸らした過去も
You're alive, so even the past you tried to look away from

66
00:07:11,698 --> 00:07:13,148
退屈な未来もカウンセリング
And that boring future are all just counseling

67
00:07:15,068 --> 00:07:15,798
やれやれ古今東西
Yare yare, from ancient times to the present, east and west

68
00:07:16,378 --> 00:07:17,328
ピースピース Unhappy? Unlucky? Be happy! Undead
Peace, peace! Unhappy? Unlucky? Be happy! Undead!

69
00:07:30,996 --> 00:07:32,126
ねぇ何だかどうして戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
Hey, what is it? I feel like we're fighting for some reason

70
00:07:34,496 --> 00:07:35,396
触れられない 触れたくもない
I can't touch them, and I don't even want to touch them

71
00:07:36,586 --> 00:07:37,756
過去の自分 自分 自分 自分と もうとっくに死んでる 透明な亡霊と対決
Confronting transparent ghosts alongside my past self, self, self, self

72
00:07:40,886 --> 00:07:41,596
幼くて痛い記憶の奥 残念?
A lingering memory deep inside those childish, painful days

73
00:07:44,836 --> 00:07:45,436
もういないのに あれ? そっちが良い? アイロニー
Already gone? Oh? Which way is better? Irony

74
00:07:47,166 --> 00:07:48,576
透かされているのは現在の自分? ナンセンス 消えないレッテル
Is the current me the one being seen through? Nonsense, an unerasable label

75
00:07:52,136 --> 00:07:53,126
Yes 要はコンプレックス 取り憑かれているみたい
Yes, it's a complex, like I'm being possessed

76
00:07:54,836 --> 00:07:55,866
巻き付いたまま離れない 在りし日の自分
Bound tightly to the person I used to be

77
00:07:57,746 --> 00:07:58,446
Undead 死んじゃいない
Undead, you're not dead yet

78
00:07:59,946 --> 00:08:01,866
お前とお前の連鎖 生きていることとは
You and your chains keep on living

79
00:08:09,016 --> 00:08:09,766
変わり続けることだ
Continuing to change

80
00:08:10,526 --> 00:08:11,786
不不幸に甘んじて満足するなよ
Don't be complacent in your misery and get satisfied

81
00:08:13,976 --> 00:08:15,536
幸せになろうとしないなんて卑怯だ
How cowardly not even trying to find happiness

82
00:08:18,006 --> 00:08:18,666
この世この世は奇怪奇怪ファンタジー
This world, this world is one bizarre fantasy

83
00:08:20,576 --> 00:08:21,716
次は鬼が出るか蛇が出るか
Who knows if a demon or a snake will appear next?

84
00:08:23,566 --> 00:08:24,966
出会って会ってやっと始まる物語
Finally encountering each other and starting our story

85
00:08:26,986 --> 00:08:28,466
さ人とかばけものが 架空大ピースピース
With people, monsters, and beasts - back to the main topic

86
00:08:37,916 --> 00:08:38,686
なんだかどうして未来になんぞ何の希望もない
Hey, what is it? Why do I feel like there's no hope

87
00:08:40,596 --> 00:08:42,366
期待出来ないような気がして
Or expectations for the future at all?

88
00:08:43,696 --> 00:08:44,956
もう随分生きている
I've already lived for quite a long time

89
00:08:45,396 --> 00:08:46,556
既視感とテンプレで食傷
Dejavu and templates have given me food poisoning

90
00:08:47,526 --> 00:08:48,576
素敵な出来事の気配もない
Not even a hint of anything wonderful happening

91
00:08:50,266 --> 00:08:51,236
残念 積んだ経験の因果
Alas, piled-up experiences and consequences

92
00:08:52,566 --> 00:08:53,456
形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
Mythology turned into a skeleton and boring evolution

93
00:08:54,496 --> 00:08:55,596
要は刺激が欲しいんだ
Basically, I just want a thrill

94
00:08:56,086 --> 00:08:56,896
飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった なんて整っていくガイダンス
I got bored, I got used to it, they say as guidance gets tidied up

95
00:08:59,406 --> 00:09:00,276
増えるコンプライアンス 蓋されてくみたい
With increasing compliance, it's like being put under a lid

96
00:09:02,516 --> 00:09:03,586
吸い尽くしてあれもこれもどれも
I've consumed it all, and this, that, and everything else

97
00:09:06,966 --> 00:09:08,326
同じ味がする
All end up tasting the exact same

98
00:09:09,766 --> 00:09:10,366
Undead 死んじゃいない
Undead, you're not dead yet

99
00:09:11,786 --> 00:09:13,576
お前とお前の連鎖
I'm telling you, your chains and you

100
00:09:13,636 --> 00:09:14,486
いつの世も過去も未来も今にあるんだ
In any era, past and future exist right now in the present

101
00:09:17,126 --> 00:09:18,086
生きていることを愚直に果せよ
Fulfill what it means to be alive and honestly keep moving

102
00:09:19,926 --> 00:09:20,656
目指せハッピーエンド
Aim for a happy ending

103
00:09:22,516 --> 00:09:23,646
Undead 死んじゃいない お前に言っているんだ
Undead, I'm telling you, you're not dead yet

104
00:09:26,786 --> 00:09:27,736
幸せを諦めてしまうような人であれ
To be a person who gives up on happiness

105
00:09:29,356 --> 00:09:31,016
ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ
Just getting used to the pain and enduring it

106
00:09:33,596 --> 00:09:34,646
死んでいるも同然 屍のアンデッド
Is no different from being dead, a corpse of the undead

107
00:09:38,686 --> 00:09:39,446
Unhappy? 悩める人の子よ
Unhappy? To all you troubled souls out there

108
00:09:40,046 --> 00:09:41,146
Unlucky? 人成らざる者も
Unlucky? To those who don't fit in as humans

109
00:09:41,596 --> 00:09:42,556
Be happy! 絶えず目指せよ
Be happy! Keep aiming forward without stopping

110
00:09:43,166 --> 00:09:44,196
生きているんだろ 目を逸らした過去も
You must be alive, even the past you tried to look away from

111
00:09:45,766 --> 00:09:47,526
不幸に浸るも 幸せに浸るのも 全部全部全部お前だ
And happiness that turns to misery, all, all, all of it is you

112
00:09:49,526 --> 00:09:50,396
古コン東西 一切合切 森羅万象 ピースピース
Ancient and modern, east and west, all combined, all creations, peace, peace!

113
00:09:52,466 --> 00:09:53,126
Past & future can't change the past

114
00:09:55,706 --> 00:09:57,746
Past & future run for the future

115
00:09:59,136 --> 00:09:59,936
人の在る所に何時も憂い事
Where people gather, there are always troubles

116
00:10:01,176 --> 00:10:02,566
生き抜けこの化物ばかりの物語
Survive through this story of nothing but monsters

117
00:10:14,226 --> 00:10:16,626
はい、というわけでみなさんこんにちは！
Hi everyone, and welcome!

118
00:10:16,626 --> 00:10:19,746
ホロライブに来て初めてのスバル……
My first time coming to Hololive as Subaru...

119
00:10:19,746 --> 00:10:25,106
というわけで、大空スバル6周年記念ライブ星耀にお越しくださりありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming to Subaru Oozora's 6th Anniversary Live, "Hoshiakari"!

120
00:10:27,986 --> 00:10:31,406
ライブ始まる、始まる！
The live is starting, starting!

121
00:10:31,406 --> 00:10:35,986
というわけで今回の配信のハッシュタグは右上のこちらになるので
So the hashtag for today's stream is right up here in the top right,

122
00:10:36,109 --> 00:10:41,446
Xでいっぱいポストしてください！よろしくお願いします！
so please post a lot on X! Thank you very much!

123
00:10:42,306 --> 00:10:47,166
ハッシュタグは大空スバル6周年ライブになります！はい！
The hashtag will be #OozoraSubaru6thAnniversaryLive! Yes!

124
00:10:47,706 --> 00:10:53,926
なんか駆け抜けてきましたけれども、ここからまだまだライブは続きますので！
We've been running right through it, but the live is still going to continue!

125
00:10:54,206 --> 00:11:03,306
ということで、次の曲はなんと、スバルの大好きなあのゲームの、あの曲を歌いたいと思います！
And for the next song, I'll sing that song from the game Subaru loves so much!

126
00:11:04,106 --> 00:11:04,926
ちょっとじゃあ、場所に移動して。
Hold on, let me move to position.

127
00:11:04,926 --> 00:11:09,506
よいしょよいしょ。
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

128
00:11:10,306 --> 00:11:13,866
はい、というわけで、それでは聴いてください。
Hi, well then, please listen.

129
00:11:14,246 --> 00:11:17,246
いとしさと せつなさと 心強さと
"Koishisa to Setsunasa to Kokorozuyosa to"

130
00:11:25,019 --> 00:11:31,699
恋しさと せつなさと 心強さと
With love, with sadness, with strength,

131
00:11:32,319 --> 00:11:38,979
いつも 感じている あなたへと向かって
I always feel them, heading towards you.

132
00:11:39,359 --> 00:11:46,059
あやまち人は おそられずに 進むあなたを
Without fearing mistakes, as you move forward,

133
00:11:46,339 --> 00:11:51,979
涙は見せないで 見つめていたいよ
I want to watch you without showing my tears.

134
00:12:11,087 --> 00:12:16,707
遠い空を あの日 眺めていた
Gazing at the distant sky that day,

135
00:12:17,347 --> 00:12:25,007
やりかけの青春も 経験も そのままで
With unfinished youth and experiences just as they were,

136
00:12:25,447 --> 00:12:31,987
永遠を夢見ていた あの日を今、
That day when I dreamed of eternity, now...

137
00:12:32,487 --> 00:12:40,367
もう二度とくりかえさずに もどらずに 生きることが
Living without repeating it, without turning back,

138
00:12:40,727 --> 00:12:45,507
できなくて あこがれて
Being unable to, yet longing for it,

139
00:12:45,507 --> 00:12:54,447
でも 少しずつ 理解してきた 戦うこと！！
Yet little by little, I've come to understand: fighting!!

140
00:12:55,187 --> 00:13:03,027
悲しくて 泣きたくて 叫びたくても
Even if I'm sad, want to cry, and want to scream,

141
00:13:03,407 --> 00:13:10,687
あなたを 信じている 言葉にできない
I believe in you, though I can't put it into words.

142
00:13:11,267 --> 00:13:18,547
あやまち人は おそられずに 進むあなたを
Without fearing mistakes, as you move forward,

143
00:13:19,067 --> 00:13:26,107
涙は見せないで 信じていたいよ
I want to keep believing in you without showing my tears.

144
00:13:43,067 --> 00:13:50,027
誰の目にも とまることのないまま
Passing by unnoticed by anyone's eyes,

145
00:13:50,367 --> 00:13:57,627
街角のポスターは 色あせて消えていく
The posters on the street corner fade and disappear.

146
00:13:58,027 --> 00:14:04,847
だけど あなたへの想いは きっと
Yet my feelings for you will surely

147
00:14:06,147 --> 00:14:12,107
消えないで いつまでも 迷わずに残ってる
Not fade, remaining forever without hesitation.

148
00:14:12,307 --> 00:14:19,227
偶然 でも 会えなくて
Even by chance, we can't meet,

149
00:14:19,227 --> 00:14:28,567
でも世界中で1人だけは 伝えたい！！
