That's all for the merch and album info for Subaru's 6th anniversary live! Everyone please buy lots! Thank you!

560
00:47:31,986 --> 00:47:35,786
はい！そしてなんと、いよいよライブも終盤戦ということで！
Yes! And now, the live is finally reaching its final stretch!

561
00:47:36,186 --> 00:47:44,986
それでは、次の曲のチャンピオンへ！それでは聴いてください！
Now, to the champion of the next song! Please listen!

562
00:47:57,760 --> 00:48:02,660
どこまでも続くような青の季節は
The season of blue that seemed to go on forever,

563
00:48:03,430 --> 00:48:09,500
四つ並ぶ窓この前を塞ぐものは何もない
Four lined-up windows, nothing blocks what's ahead.

564
00:48:10,560 --> 00:48:15,150
アスファルトと蝉時雨を反射して
Reflecting the asphalt and the chorus of cicadas,

565
00:48:15,610 --> 00:48:20,410
君という沈黙が聞こえなくなる
I can no longer hear the silence called you.

566
00:48:21,250 --> 00:48:28,530
この日々が色褪せる僕と違う君の匂いを知ってしまっても
Even if these days fade, and I learn a scent different from yours,

567
00:48:29,340 --> 00:48:34,400
置き忘れてきた永遠のそこに
In that eternity we left behind,

568
00:48:35,360 --> 00:48:39,320
今でも青が住んでいる
The blue still lives there,

569
00:48:39,320 --> 00:48:42,220
今でも青が住んでいる
The blue still lives there.

570
00:48:42,470 --> 00:48:47,680
どんな祈りも言葉も近づけるのに届かなかった
No matter how close prayers and words got, they couldn't reach.

571
00:48:48,390 --> 00:48:54,400
まるで仕掛けた恋のような魔法だった夏のようないろのなか
Like a set-up romance, it was magic amidst colors like summer.

572
00:48:54,780 --> 00:49:01,380
切り落とす言葉がずっと喉の奥に仕えているまた会えるよねって
Words to cut off are stuck deep in my throat— 'We'll meet again, right?'

573
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:05,940
声にならない声
A voice that cannot become a voice.

574
00:49:15,370 --> 00:49:20,220
眠る下がりじめつく風の季節は
The season of wind clinging as we sleep,

575
00:49:20,900 --> 00:49:26,760
思い出すまだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
Reminds me of our portraits when we were still nobodies.

576
00:49:27,580 --> 00:49:32,330
何もかもも分かり合えたはずだった
We must have understood everything about each other.

577
00:49:32,920 --> 00:49:39,760
あの日から少しずつ君と違う僕という呪いが解けていく
Ever since that day, little by little, the curse of being myself, different from you, lifts.

578
00:49:51,320 --> 00:49:54,320
君の笑顔の奥の憂いも
Even the sorrow deep within your smile,

579
00:49:54,986 --> 00:50:01,486
身を閉した孤独や見尽くして
And the closed-off loneliness, seeing through them all...

580
00:51:10,051 --> 00:51:11,711
Starlight

581
00:51:11,091 --> 00:51:14,991
繋いで 繰り返してく衝動
Connecting them, repeating impulses.

582
00:51:20,031 --> 00:51:22,631
僕らは止まらない きらり 輝いてゆけ
We can't stop, shining brightly.

583
00:51:40,931 --> 00:51:44,271
地を蹴った足取りは 弾んだリズムで
With the rhythm of our stepping feet,

584
00:51:45,671 --> 00:51:50,511
キミの心の壁を また奏らす
repeating the echoes in your heart.

585
00:51:51,471 --> 00:51:56,471
光線となって やがて形作ったキャンバスの上
Light becomes a beam, eventually forming a canvas.

586
00:51:58,911 --> 00:52:01,471
灯る道 満開 星屑
A shining path to light our way,

587
00:52:02,271 --> 00:52:05,271
迷いはしない また前を向けるから
I will never lose my way, facing forward once again.

588
00:52:10,171 --> 00:52:10,551
Fly again 飛ぶんだ
Fly again, let's fly away.

589
00:52:12,751 --> 00:52:16,391
導かれたこの舞台 いつか聞こえる日まで
This stage that guided us will someday reach the day we hear it.

590
00:52:20,831 --> 00:52:25,231
空高く掲げた 手を重ね
Lifting our hands high into the sky, stacking them together,

591
00:52:26,031 --> 00:52:32,231
ぶっこわした限界の その先へ
breaking past the limits and heading beyond!

592
00:52:41,271 --> 00:52:45,671
思わず涙が こぼれ落ちそうな そんな夜には
Tears threaten to spill over on such a night,

593
00:52:48,511 --> 00:52:50,071
連れてくよ さあ 一緒に 夜空に差し込む
let's take a journey together, stealing into the night sky.

594
00:52:53,711 --> 00:52:54,711
きらめくスターライト いつでも届けたい
Sparkling starlight, I always want to reach you,

595
00:52:58,511 --> 00:53:00,151
笑顔になる歌があるから
because there is a song that will make you smile.

596
00:53:05,511 --> 00:53:08,111
Be the star 歌おう 一面 染まる金世界
Be the star, let's sing across a stained golden world,

597
00:53:12,271 --> 00:53:13,711
今も まだ焼き付いて
where it is still vividly burned into my mind.

598
00:53:16,271 --> 00:53:20,031
空高く響いた 激情 まだ最高潮
Soaring high, echoing with a passion that reaches a new peak,

599
00:53:21,631 --> 00:53:25,551
昨日よりも翔けるんだ 遠くまで
let's reach even further than yesterday!

600
00:53:57,071 --> 00:53:58,911
Fly again 飛ぶんだ
Fly again, let's fly away,

601
00:53:59,391 --> 00:54:02,431
指先触れた 結晶
with the crystal that brushed our fingertips.

602
00:54:06,551 --> 00:54:08,631
Be the star なるんだ キミの一等星
Be the star, let's become your guiding first-magnitude star!

603
00:54:16,711 --> 00:54:18,711
Starlight 輝け 僕らは いつだってここにいるよ
Starlight, shine on! We will always be right here,

604
00:54:24,551 --> 00:54:26,151
願いよ届け
so please let our wishes reach you.

605
00:54:27,631 --> 00:54:32,071
無限の宇宙を 流れる星となって
Flowing like shooting stars through the infinite cosmos,

606
00:54:32,471 --> 00:54:36,391
キミと僕ら照らす その先へ
illuminating both you and me, heading towards that future,

607
00:54:38,951 --> 00:54:42,271
超えて 超えて
pushing past everything...

608
00:55:13,717 --> 00:55:18,747
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ傷つけて傷ついたって
No matter how far we run through, even if we get hurt,

609
00:55:20,877 --> 00:55:23,677
明日は笑っていたいな
Tomorrow, I want to be smiling.

610
00:55:24,247 --> 00:55:28,917
間違いもいつかのための正解でしょ
Even mistakes will someday be the right answer, right?

611
00:55:29,137 --> 00:55:34,807
転んだって泣いたって不器用でいいじゃんさあ行くんだ
Falling down, crying, being clumsy is fine, so let's go!

612
00:55:44,647 --> 00:55:49,407
色褪せたこの世界で繰り返していくだけの毎日
In this fading world, living days repeating over and over,

613
00:55:49,937 --> 00:55:54,877
言えずにいた言葉を風に乗せて一人呟いた
I whispered the words I couldn't say into the wind.

614
00:55:55,237 --> 00:55:59,857
素直になるためにはまだまだ勇気が足りないけど
To become honest, I still don't have enough courage, but

615
00:55:59,977 --> 00:56:04,817
水しぶき上げて飛び込んだ目をつぶりながら
closing my eyes, I splashed and jumped in!

616
00:56:05,307 --> 00:56:10,297
悪天候に虹を描いて青く塗りつぶした
Drawing a rainbow in bad weather, painting it blue,

617
00:56:10,767 --> 00:56:15,237
扉開けて飛び出そうよはじめての未来へ
Breaking the door open, let's fly out to our first future!

618
00:56:15,927 --> 00:56:20,537
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ傷つけて傷ついたって
No matter how far we run through, even if we get hurt,

619
00:56:22,667 --> 00:56:25,707
明日は笑っていたいな
Tomorrow, I want to be smiling.

620
00:56:26,237 --> 00:56:30,977
間違いもいつかのための正解でしょ
Even mistakes will someday be the right answer, right?

621
00:56:31,357 --> 00:56:36,437
顔上げて走り出そうひとりぼっちがふたりで
With my head held high, let's start running—just the two of us!

622
00:56:36,607 --> 00:56:41,907
転んだって泣いたって不器用でいいじゃんさあ行くんだ
Falling down, crying, being clumsy is fine, so let's go!

623
00:56:51,517 --> 00:56:56,707
何が正解で不正解かもときどきわからなくなって
What is right and what is wrong, sometimes I don't even know,

624
00:56:56,967 --> 00:57:01,817
涙こらえながら答えを探し続けてたんだ
holding back tears, I kept searching for the answer.

625
00:57:02,067 --> 00:57:07,077
溢れた涙見つけた笑顔全部宝箱にしまって
Put all the overflowing tears and found smiles into a treasure chest,

626
00:57:07,317 --> 00:57:12,677
いつか立ち止まったら思い出してまた笑いたいな
so that whenever I stop, I can remember and smile again.

627
00:57:22,937 --> 00:57:27,767
満天の星空を描いて願い事をしよう
Drawing a starry sky as far as the eye can see, let's make a wish!

628
00:57:27,937 --> 00:57:32,947
流れ星も描き足そうか僕次第で変わるんだ
Drawing shooting stars, can we make them come true? It depends on us!

629
00:57:35,587 --> 00:57:40,517
いつまでもこの日々が続くといいな
I hope these days last forever.

630
00:57:40,667 --> 00:57:45,587
望んだって叶わないことだらけでも悪くないな
Even if most of my wishes don't come true, that's not so bad.

631
00:57:46,097 --> 00:57:51,167
明日へとこの歌が届くといいな
I hope this song reaches tomorrow too,

632
00:57:51,307 --> 00:57:55,997
手を取って笑い合ってありのままを描いていくんだ
taking hands and laughing together, let's paint our true selves!

633
00:57:56,237 --> 00:58:00,947
どこまでも僕ら駆け抜けていくんだ傷つけて傷ついたって
No matter how far we run through, even if we get hurt,

634
00:58:02,837 --> 00:58:05,857
明日は笑っていたいな
Tomorrow, I want to be smiling.

635
00:58:06,557 --> 00:58:11,207
間違いもいつかのための正解だから
Even mistakes will someday be the right answer, right?

636
00:58:11,517 --> 00:58:16,697
顔上げて走り出そうひとりぼっちがふたりで
With my head held high, let's start running—just the two of us!

637
00:58:16,907 --> 00:58:22,077
転んだって泣いたって不器用でいいじゃんさあ行くんだ
Falling down, crying, being clumsy is fine, so let's go!

638
00:58:25,707 --> 00:58:33,207
どこまでも駆け抜けていくんだ
No matter how far we run through!

639
01:00:04,190 --> 01:00:09,190
君とスバルの未来が幸せでいっぱいでありますように!!
May your future with Subaru be full of happiness!!

